  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\nalterations to remove the main access door on the Northolt Road frontage and replace it with glazing would result in an inactive Primary Shopping frontage to the detriment\r\nof the vitality and viability of the Primary Shopping frontage contrary to Policy\r\nD3 D(6) of the London Plan (2021), &amp;nbsp;Policy\r\nDM36(d) of &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;the Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policies (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed pedestrian access route is unacceptable due to the existing access arrangement for residents on conjunction with the outward opening access door on the proposed main pedestrian route would prejudice safe pedestrian movement and result in direct conflict and disturbance between customers and residents, particularly those residents with mobility issues, contrary to Policies D3 D(5) and D5 B(4) of the London Plan (2021), DM1 B(a, b and f), DM2 A(a) and DM36(d) of the Harrow Development Management Policies (2013).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
